        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<br>\n<dl><dd><b>Title</b> Rain against the Window</dd>\n<dd><b>Artist</b> cori</dd>\n<dd><b>Original mp3 data</b> Length:1:21 minutes (1.25 MB) Format:MP3 Mono 44kHz 128Kbps (CBR)</dd>\n<dd><b>User tags</b> England, Rain, Weather, Wind, Window</dd>\n<dd><b>Type</b> Single Subject, Natural</dd>\n<dd><b>PDSounds record number</b> 600</dd>\n<dd><b>Comment</b> A typical English summer day ... the sound of rain lashing against the window pane and gusts of wind blowing at gale-force straight off the sea.  Recorded this morning by lying the mic on the window sill and uploaded without any audio changes other than a small amplification of the whole file.</dd></dl>",
